{"5404710":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Kill The Boss","steam_appid":5404710,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop looking at the horizon. <strong>It is already in the arena.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emperor calls you commander and points. That is the whole speech. Something huge wants the ground under your feet, and it brought a line of friends who get worse every time one of them drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House-sized slimes. Frogs with no business being that tall. Bamboo that decided to stand up. Tengu. Demons. A spirit big enough to blot out the yard. They take turns. They do not take a hint.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ninjas are out. The fire is lit. Stone is already coming down. You land the first blow. They do not wait for a second order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emperor will keep watching until the arena is empty and he has no one left to name.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the boss, Commander.<\/strong><\/h2>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop looking at the horizon. <strong>It is already in the arena.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emperor calls you commander and points. That is the whole speech. Something huge wants the ground under your feet, and it brought a line of friends who get worse every time one of them drops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House-sized slimes. Frogs with no business being that tall. Bamboo that decided to stand up. Tengu. Demons. A spirit big enough to blot out the yard. They take turns. They do not take a hint.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ninjas are out. The fire is lit. Stone is already coming down. You land the first blow. They do not wait for a second order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emperor will keep watching until the arena is empty and he has no one left to name.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the boss, Commander.<\/strong><\/h2>","short_description":"Commander. Kill what steps into the arena. When it drops, something worse takes its place. You land the first blow. Your ninjas do not wait for a second order. The fire stays lit. The stone keeps falling. Leave the yard empty.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5404710\/b4c597e1e6e89b68d7fef1bebba97d0b265ed5d4\/header.jpg?t=1793697346","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5404710\/53cccb3f2bcf5cba1c6e8b40a0dd4624849951e4\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793697346","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5404710\/53cccb3f2bcf5cba1c6e8b40a0dd4624849951e4\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793697346","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core ~2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU with 1 GB VRAM (Intel HD 4000+ \/ any modern iGPU)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 512 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core ~2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated or stronger iGPU (e.g. GTX 1050 \/